<title>UK: Brit Biotech Q2 losses widen.</title>
<headline>Brit Biotech Q2 losses widen.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter to October 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		1.3 loss	     vs 0.8 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 nil		    vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     8.1 loss	     vs 4.0 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   0.3		    vs 3.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Drug research group British Biotech Plc said losses were &quot;well within budget.&quot; It said the drop in turnover reflected the receipt of 3 million stg in payments a year before from Glaxo Wellcome Plc for development and marketing rights to arthritis drug BB-2983.</p>
<p> Operating result	 10.8 loss	    vs 4.4 loss</p>
<p> Exceptional		nil		    vs nil</p>
<p> Interest receivable    2.8		    vs 0.4</p>
<p> Tax			  0.01		   vs nil</p>
<p> Net taxed		  8.1		    vs 4.0</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
